{# ================================================================
   Building a Software Factory
   DevCon · October 13, 2026 · BNY Offices, Pittsburgh, PA · TODO duration

   Modern-engine orchestration layer. This file chooses the brand and
   the slide order; it contains no HTML. Every rendered slide comes
   from a macro under modules/<topic>/ so other decks can reuse it.
   See AGENTS.md for the primitive contract.

   ── Structure ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Same spine as the CSA Birmingham governance deck — make the rules,
   enforce the rules, update the rules — reframed as a production line
   for a developer audience at large, regulated companies. The opening
   tension is "great... in theory": the whiteboard factory vs. the
   auditor, the regulator, and three platform teams. The close is the
   compounding argument: structure is speed.

   First cut, planned against 45 minutes (~30 content slides). See
   IDEAS.md for the run of show and the three slides still to write.

   Modules that resolve the brand pack themselves are imported WITH
   CONTEXT — without it `branding` is undefined at load time and the
   path collapses to modules/branding//primitives.j2. See AGENTS.md.
   ================================================================ #}

